── absent --pattern ──
grepsafe: --pattern is required
usage: grepsafe.sh --pattern 'regex' [--path dir] [--glob '*.ts']
fix: pass the regex to search for — grepsafe.sh --pattern 'paddleOut|wipeout'

── bad --head ──
grepsafe: --head must be a positive integer of at most 18 digits
  got: -5
fix: pass a whole number above zero, or omit --head for no limit — grepsafe.sh --pattern 'paddleOut' --head 20

── root named twice ──
grepsafe: the search root was named twice
  first: .
  then:  alsohere
fix: name each root with --path; a bare positional root stands alone — grepsafe.sh --pattern 'paddleOut' --path src --path test

── path outside the repo ──
grepsafe: search path must be within the git repository
  repo root:   /tmp/TEMP_DIR
  search path: /etc
  named by:    --path
fix: name a path under the repo root: no '..' segments, and an absolute path must itself sit under that root — grepsafe.sh --pattern 'paddleOut on the reef break' --path /tmp/TEMP_DIR
"
`;

